{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-09-07T10:38:35.442Z","sessionId":"ca3a75df-2082-45a9-8c6c-1f27509fd9f1","content":"This is a C++ authentication system. Both AuthToken and AuthService have a method\nnamed `validate`.\n\nThe auth token's `validate` method performs the low-level integrity check on a raw\ntoken string. Find its implementation — not the auth service's validate — and add\nthe following diagnostic line at the very start of the method body:\n\n    std::cerr << \"[AuthToken] validate\\n\";\n\nDo not modify AuthService::validate.\n"}
